-- L4DEL: intuition: Under the preceding hypotheses, `D[X_[m]] ≥ ∑ d, D[π_d(X_[m])| π_(d-1})(X_[m])] + I[∑ i, X_i : π_1(X_[m]) | π_1(∑ i, X_i)]`.
