@file PFR/TorsionEndgame.lean
@decl dist_of_U_add_le
-- L4DEL: title: Documented declaration: dist_of_U_add_le
-- L4DEL: intuition: Let $G$ be an abelian group, let $(T_1,T_2,T_3)$ be a $G^3$-valued random variable such that $T_1+T_2+T_3=0$ holds identically, and write \[ \delta := \bbI[T_1 : T_2] + \bbI[T_1 : T_3] + \bbI[T_2 : T_3]. \] Let $Y_1,\dots,Y_n$ be some further $G$-valued random variables and let $\alpha>0$ be a constant. Then there exists a random variable $U$ such that $$ d[U;U] + \alpha \sum_{i=1}^n d[Y_i;U] \leq \Bigl(2 + \frac{\alpha n}{2} \Bigr) \delta + \alpha \sum_{i=1}^n d[Y_i;T_2].$$
-- L4DEL: step: This explanation is a condensed rendering of the declaration's own doc comment at the pinned source commit; consult the exact Lean statement below for authority.

